# This repository tracks the v3 Lewix site ONLY.
#
# v1-ascii-mountain and v2-raw-3d are local prototypes kept on disk for
# reference; public-shared/ holds their assets, including an 84MB
# mountain-hq.glb that has no business in git history. v3-lewix-site is fully
# self-contained — every asset it loads at runtime resolves inside its own
# public/ folder — so nothing below is needed to build or run it.
v1-ascii-mountain/
v2-raw-3d/
public-shared/

# Root package.json/lock belong to the Vite prototypes above, not to v3.
/package.json
/package-lock.json

node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
